OL,3,ABurnham's Man City comments 'completely
OL,4,Aout of touch', Tories say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham's comments about
OL,7,FManchester City's breach of Premier
OL,8,FLeague financial rules were "completely
OL,9,Fout of touch" with fans and the public,
OL,10,Fthe Conservatives have said.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said on Wednesday he
OL,13,Fwould be "really concerned" if the
OL,14,Fclub's owners decide to sell up after
OL,15,FCity was found guilty by an independent
OL,16,Fcommission of most of the 115 charges
OL,17,Fthey faced.
OL,19,FHis remarks raised many eyebrows in the
OL,20,Ffootball community, with the Tories now
OL,21,Fweighing in to call them "frankly
OL,22,Fextraordinary".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
